behaviour:
The generated bundle for locale L and prefix list P is the UTF-8 text "window.almworks.util.resources('" + L.toString() + "', {
", then one entry per message joined by ",
", then "
});". Each entry is "'" + key + "':" + the encoded text, with the key written as is. The messages come from Jira's I18nHelper for L (I18nHelper.BeanFactory.getInstance(L)): P is trimmed as a whole and split at commas (the parts are not trimmed individually), and for each prefix in order every key from getKeysForPrefix(prefix) is added with getUnescapedText(key) as its text. Keys matched by several prefixes appear several times; no prefix gives an empty object.
